High priority:

- Various parts of GtkHx UI don't work well with Dark Theme
 - Tracker list entries use black text instead of white
 - User list icons look weird with dark background
 - Tasks in the "Tasks" window are unclear. We need a better progress bar

- Tracker layout is too compact / busy, doesn't have enough spacing
- Clicking on the columns in the Tracker window doesn't sort the entries by that column
- Opening Options, closing them, and opening them again fails

(gtkhx:226190): Gtk-CRITICAL **: 14:07:36.189: gtk_window_present: assertion 'GTK_IS_WINDOW (window)' failed

Medium priority:

- Whenever a dialog pops up, a warning is emitted

Gtk-Message: 12:10:16.131: GtkDialog mapped without a transient parent. This is discouraged.

Low priority:

- The connection to hlserver.com eventually gets closed for some reason (possibly server timeout). If it is
  a server activity timeout, it would be nice to indicate that

Won't Fix:

- Window position saving does not work on Wayland
